nted.\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- The evidence package contains the complete module inventory, build\n57\t  attestations, and test results for every serving-stack image in scope.\n58\t- All defined security review board milestone sign-offs are recorded.\n59\t- The package is submitted to the external accredited certification laboratory.\n60\t- Responses from the review board or laboratory are triaged and either\n61\t  resolved with evidence or routed as follow-up work with owners.\n62\t- Note: laboratory turnaround (historically six to nine months) and\n63\t  review-board cadence are externally controlled and are schedule constraints,\n64\t  not completion criteria for engineering work.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-2 (P0): a compliance evidence package is assembled and submitted through\n69\t  the security review board to the external certification lab.\n70\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b5ebd1102387e562","agent_id":"afadad7e70f969e0e","session_id":"95f10158-af0c-4809-b17b-36c6f2e3eed3","uuid":"8237a85c-683b-4994-86cc-278bdc12476a","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:40:23.913Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bfba58daee8e2236","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
