 image runs correctly on a FIPS-enabled OpenShift\n54\t  cluster and successfully manages the serving stack lifecycle.\n55\t- No non-validated crypto library is linked in the operator's request/reconcile\n56\t  path.\n57\t- Build attestations and test results are recorded and available as\n58\t  certification evidence.\n59\t- Any dependency that cannot be remediated is explicitly documented with its\n60\t  blocking reason and owner.\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- HLR-1 (P0): serving-stack images (including the operator that deploys them)\n65\t  run correctly on FIPS-enabled clusters using validated crypto modules.\n66\t- HLR-2 (P0, supporting): contributes build attestations and test results to\n67\t  the evidence package.\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-862531359d50711e","agent_id":"afa810437c52592cd","session_id":"95f10158-af0c-4809-b17b-36c6f2e3eed3","uuid":"65f7ec60-473c-4952-a584-c6d61cbc223b","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:44:57.987Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-80d36a6c0ef4d85b","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
