cceptance Criteria\n52\t\n53\t- All KServe and serving data plane images run correctly on a FIPS-enabled\n54\t  OpenShift cluster: models deploy and serve inference requests successfully.\n55\t- No non-validated crypto library is linked in the inference request path of\n56\t  any serving image.\n57\t- Build attestations and test results for each remediated image are recorded\n58\t  and available as certification evidence.\n59\t- Any request-path dependency that cannot be remediated is explicitly\n60\t  documented with its blocking reason and owner.\n61\t- Rollback: because this epic ships rebuilt images rather than replacing a\n62\t  running system, the prior image tags remain deployable; reverting a\n63\t  deployment to the pre-remediation tag restores the previous behavior on a\n64\t  FIPS-enabled cluster without additional migration steps.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-1 (P0): serving-stack images run correctly on FIPS-enabled clusters\n69\t  using validated crypto modules.\n70\t- HLR-2 (P0, supporting): produces the build attestations and test results the\n71\t  evidence package requires.\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8a78dfcbc2c3fb87","agent_id":"a752be556e5bc2e5f","session_id":"95f10158-af0c-4809-b17b-36c6f2e3eed3","uuid":"dc284355-e381-4474-94df-0d408aaeaa15","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:49:09.274Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-95d2bb9ac3149d87","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
