n54\t  pipelines.\n55\t- The classification the check encodes stays in sync with the FIPS crypto\n56\t  module inventory.\n57\t\n58\t## HLR Traceability\n59\t\n60\t- HLR-3 (P1): CI enforces FIPS regressions — a gating check fails any\n61\t  serving-stack build that reintroduces non-validated crypto usage.\n62\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8a78dfcbc2c3fb87","agent_id":"a752be556e5bc2e5f","session_id":"95f10158-af0c-4809-b17b-36c6f2e3eed3","uuid":"ef4450e3-0968-4b7e-a484-33e6cc8e5507","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:49:11.333Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9fc1d777f85a6902","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
